WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.707
Unit sixteen. Respectful Friendships!

2
00:00:04.673 --> 00:00:08.436
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.486 --> 00:00:12.052
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.102 --> 00:00:16.223
Today we learn about Respectful Friendships. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.925 --> 00:00:20.458
Respect. Say it with me. Respect!

6
00:00:23.957 --> 00:00:27.490
Trust. Say it with me. Trust!

7
00:00:30.993 --> 00:00:34.660
Honesty. Say it with me. Honesty!

8
00:00:38.196 --> 00:00:41.979
Boundaries. Say it with me. Boundaries!

9
00:00:45.454 --> 00:00:49.121
Kindness. Say it with me. Kindness!

10
00:00:52.609 --> 00:00:55.792
Listen. Say it with me. Listen!

11
00:00:59.275 --> 00:01:02.809
Conflict. Say it with me. Conflict!

12
00:01:06.309 --> 00:01:09.892
Support. Say it with me. Support!

13
00:01:13.447 --> 00:01:22.616
Respectful friendships are built on trust, honesty, and kindness. Good friends listen and respect each other's boundaries. They solve conflict calmly and give support.

14
00:01:22.666 --> 00:01:23.816
I can do that too!

15
00:01:25.071 --> 00:01:30.287
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:30.337 --> 00:01:31.487
Honesty!

17
00:01:32.485 --> 00:01:37.605
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:37.655 --> 00:01:38.805
Conflict!

19
00:01:39.799 --> 00:01:45.183
Did you know? Friends do not have to agree on everything to respect each other!

20
00:01:45.233 --> 00:01:47.214
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:47.981 --> 00:01:55.456
Think and answer. What does a respectful friend do?

22
00:01:55.506 --> 00:01:56.656
Great answer!

23
00:01:57.802 --> 00:02:02.680
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:02.730 --> 00:02:05.523
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

